- Excuse me sir.
- Yes.

1943
02:39:10.500 --> 02:39:13.460
Shalu is here. She looks worried.
Something's amiss.

1944
02:39:25.333 --> 02:39:27.883
She looks tense
and she's saying nothing.

1945
